 "This is a concept for a pick-and-place robotic arm that sorts components by colour. Before committing to actuators and materials, I built an interactive kinematic simulation to validate the reach envelope, the joint configuration, and the closing geometry of the end effector. The next phase is a physical build, with the servo and stepper motors selected against a calculated torque budget for each joint.": "这是一个按颜色分拣零件的拾放机械臂概念。在确定执行器和材料之前，我搭建了一个交互式运动学仿真，用来验证工作空间、关节配置以及末端执行器的闭合几何。下一阶段是实物制作，伺服电机和步进电机将根据每个关节计算出的扭矩预算来选型。",
