 "As part of a UTESCA consulting engagement, I led the mechanical CAD and prototyping for Finliti's financial literacy board game. I re-engineered the physical product in Autodesk Fusion to reduce its footprint by 30% while preserving its function, then validated the redesign through iterative FDM-printed prototypes and performance testing. The engagement met every one of the client's key performance indicators.": "在一次 UTESCA 咨询项目中，我负责 Finliti 金融素养桌游的机械 CAD 与原型制作。我在 Autodesk Fusion 中重新设计了实体产品，在保留功能的同时将占地面积缩小了 30%，随后通过多轮 FDM 打印原型和性能测试验证了新设计。该项目达成了客户的全部关键绩效指标。",
