 "Built an automated <strong>hyperparameter sweep pipeline</strong> in Python that trained and ranked <strong>Proximal Policy Optimization reinforcement learning agents</strong> for building cooling control on a Slurm-managed high-performance computing cluster, identifying the optimal configuration for each chiller and room thermal model combination.": "用 Python 构建了自动化的<strong>超参数扫描流水线</strong>，在 Slurm 管理的高性能计算集群上训练并排名用于建筑制冷控制的<strong>近端策略优化（PPO）强化学习智能体</strong>，为每种冷水机组与房间热模型组合找出最优配置。",
