 "Team Captain": "队长",
 "I started playing club hockey at six and never really stopped. More than a decade later, I still get out to rip pucks whenever I can, and this year I joined <strong>intramural hockey</strong>, representing the <strong>Faculty of Engineering</strong> against other UofT faculties. I've done plenty of coaching too, both privately and as a volunteer with two U11 teams at Knights Hockey Club through high school, which turned out to be great practice at explaining things clearly and adjusting on the fly.": "我六岁开始打俱乐部冰球，此后便一直没停过。十多年过去了，我依然会一有机会就上场挥杆击球，今年我还加入了<strong>校内冰球联赛</strong>，代表<strong>工程学院</strong>与其他多伦多大学院系展开角逐。 我也有丰富的执教经验，既做过私人教练，也在高中期间作为志愿者在Knights Hockey Club执教过两支U11球队，这些经历让我练就了清晰讲解和临场应变的能力。",
 "Oversee the design and integration of the full vertical-axis turbine for the 2026–2027 cycle, leading 100+ members across 6 departments and a 35-person leadership team.": "负责监督2026–2027周期完整垂直轴涡轮机的设计与集成工作，领导来自6个部门的100余名成员以及由35人组成的领导团队。",
 "Manage the team's design timeline and $50,000+ operating budget, keeping departments aligned through the design, manufacturing, and competition cycle.": "管理团队的设计时间表和超过50,000美元的运营预算，确保各部门在设计、制造和竞赛周期中保持协调一致。",
 "Support the mechanical project lead on the pitch-mechanism trade study and actuator-driven swashplate for cyclic blade pitch control through design reviews of the SolidWorks models and Ansys FEA and CFD validation.": "协助机械项目负责人开展桨叶桨距机构技术方案对比研究以及用于周期桨叶桨距控制的执行器驱动式斜盘研究，具体工作包括对SolidWorks模型进行设计评审，以及通过Ansys进行有限元分析（FEA）和计算流体动力学（CFD）验证。",
 "Increased fall recruitment activity by 55% year over year by restructuring leadership roles and the recruitment strategy.": "通过重组领导岗位和调整招聘策略，使秋季招聘活动较上年同期增长了55%。",
 "Sep 2025 – Aug 2026": "2025年9月 – 2026年8月",
 "Mechanical Team Member": "机械团队成员",
 "I started playing club hockey at six and never really stopped. More than a decade later, I still get out to rip pucks whenever I can, and this year I joined intramurals to play for the Faculty of Engineering against other UofT faculties. I've also done plenty of coaching, both privately and as a volunteer with two U11 teams at Knights Hockey Club through high school, which turned out to be great practice at explaining things clearly and adjusting on the fly.": "我六岁开始打俱乐部冰球，此后便再也没真正停下来过。十多年过去了，我依然会一有机会就上场挥杆射门，今年我还加入了校内联赛，代表工程学院与其他多伦多大学院系进行比赛。 此外，我还积累了丰富的执教经验，既有私人授课，也在高中期间作为志愿者在Knights Hockey Club执教了两支U11球队，这些经历让我练就了清晰讲解和临场应变的能力。",
 "Oversaw the design and integration of the 2026–2027 vertical-axis turbine, leading 100+ members across 6 departments and a 35-person leadership team.": "负责监督2026–2027年垂直轴涡轮机的设计与集成工作，领导来自6个部门的100余名成员以及由35人组成的领导团队。",
 "Managed the full design-cycle timeline and operating budget, growing the budget by over 115% year over year.": "负责管理整个设计周期的进度安排和运营预算，使预算同比增长超过115%。",
 "Directed projects across all departments, including QBlade and CFD airfoil selection, MPPT power electronics and a custom PCB, and a bat-detection wildlife monitoring system.": "负责统筹各部门的多个项目，包括QBlade和CFD翼型选型、MPPT电力电子设备及定制PCB，以及一套用于蝙蝠监测的野生动物监测系统。",
 "Established tool- and resource-sharing partnership agreements with University of Toronto Blue Sky Solar Racing and the University of Toronto Robotics Association.": "与多伦多大学“蓝天”太阳能赛车队（多伦多大学 Blue Sky Solar Racing）以及多伦多大学机器人协会（多伦多大学 Robotics Association）签署了工具和资源共享合作协议。",
 "Restructured leadership roles and recruitment strategy, raising fall recruitment activity by 55% year over year.": "重组了领导层职责和招聘策略，使秋季招聘活动较上年同期增长了55%。",
