 "Mechanical engineering student at the <strong>University of Toronto</strong>, minoring in robotics, business and manufacturing. I learned to ski in Banff, so here is my work as a run down the mountain.": "多伦多大学（<strong>多伦多大学</strong>）机械工程专业学生，辅修机器人技术、商业和制造业。我在班夫学会了滑雪，下面这段视频记录了我从山顶滑下山的过程。",
