 "About me": "关于我",
 "I'm in second year of Mechanical Engineering at the University of Toronto, with minors in Mechatronics and Robotics, Engineering Business, and Advanced Manufacturing.": "我目前就读于多伦多大学机械工程专业大二，辅修机电一体化与机器人技术、工程管理以及先进制造。",
 "I like problems that sit between engineering and business: the design is only half the job if nobody can build it, fund it or use it.": "我喜欢介于工程与商业之间的难题：如果没人能将其付诸实施、提供资金或加以利用，那么设计就只是工作的一半。",
