 "Client design project, APS112, 2026": "客户设计项目，APS112，2026年",
 "A powered attachment so young cross-country skiers can keep up with their parents. From eighty concepts down to two that I modelled and drew in Fusion and SolidWorks; my paddle-wheel design ranked first.": "一款动力附件，让年幼的越野滑雪者也能跟上父母的步伐。从八十个概念方案中筛选出两个，我使用Fusion和SolidWorks对它们进行了建模和绘图；我的桨轮设计最终名列第一。",
