 "Earlier builds: a <a href=\"project-bluetooth-car.html\">Bluetooth RC car</a>, an <a href=\"project-light-drawer.html\">ultrasonic light-up drawer</a>, and two <a href=\"classic.html#projects\">CANstruction sculptures</a> for the Calgary Food Bank.": "之前的作品：一辆<a href=\"project-bluetooth-car.html\">蓝牙遥控车</a>、一个<a href=\"project-light-drawer.html\">超声波感应发光抽屉</a>，以及两件为卡尔加里食品银行创作的“<a href=\"classic.html#projects\">CANstruction”雕塑</a>。",
