 "Ontario Engineering Competition 2028, May 2026 to present": "2028年安大略省工程竞赛，2026年5月至今",
 "See every role in full <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>": "查看全部经历 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>",
 "Designed, machined and wind-tunnel tested at Delft University of Technology, where it reached a cut-in speed of 4 m/s.": "我们自行设计、加工，并在代尔夫特理工大学进行风洞测试，切入风速达到4 m/s。",
