 "A powered attachment so young skiers can keep up with their parents; my paddle-wheel design ranked first.": "一款动力附件，让年幼的滑雪者也能跟上父母的步伐；我设计的桨轮方案获得了第一名。",
 "A browser simulation that checks reach, joints and gripper geometry before any hardware is bought.": "一种浏览器模拟工具，可在购买任何硬件之前，对机械臂的作业范围、关节及夹爪几何形状进行验证。",
 "A watch face and phone companion for a heat-exposure study at the University of Toronto.": "多伦多大学一项热暴露研究中使用的智能手表表盘及手机配套应用。",
 "See all nine projects <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>": "查看全部九个项目 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>",
 "Follow the Wind": "随风而行",
 "How I got here, as a journey you can fly through: from the Rockies where I grew up, through Calgary and Toronto, to the wind tunnel in Delft where my team tested our turbine.": "我是如何走到今天的？这段旅程，你可以一窥全貌：从我长大的落基山脉出发，途经卡尔加里和多伦多，最终抵达代尔夫特的风洞——我的团队正是在那里对我们的涡轮机进行了测试。",
 "Enter the 3D story <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>": "进入3D故事 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>",
 "I run along the Lake Ontario waterfront, play intramural hockey, ski in the Rockies whenever I can, and travel to see how other cities are built.": "我常在安大略湖畔慢跑，参加校内冰球比赛，一有机会就去落基山脉滑雪，还会四处旅行，观察其他城市的城市规划。",
 "Running, hobbies, travel and volunteering <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>": "跑步、爱好、旅行和志愿服务 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>",
 "Follow the Wind · Chenyu Li": "随风而行 · 李辰宇",
 "The path that brought me to engineering, from the mountains where I grew up to the wind turbine my team took across the Atlantic.": "从我长大的山间，到我的团队将风力涡轮机运送过大西洋，这段历程引领我走上了工程之路。",
