 "I grew up in Calgary, skiing in Banff and playing hockey, and started my first business at fourteen. Now I study Mechanical Engineering at the University of Toronto and spend most of my time between design teams, consulting work and research.": "我在卡尔加里长大，常去班夫滑雪和打冰球，十四岁时创办了第一家公司。现在我在多伦多大学攻读机械工程专业，大部分时间都在设计团队、咨询工作和科研之间分配。",
 "I like problems that sit between engineering and business: a design is only half done if nobody can build it, fund it or use it. Outside of class I run along the waterfront (": "我喜欢介于工程与商业之间的难题：如果没人能将其付诸实施、为其提供资金或加以利用，那么设计就只完成了一半。下课后，我常沿着滨水区跑步（",
